OL,3,AUK expected to announce sanctions on
OL,4,AIsraeli settlements in occupied West
OL,5,ABank
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK is expected to announce
OL,8,Fsanctions on goods and services from
OL,9,FIsraeli settlements in the illegally
OL,10,Foccupied West Bank
OL,12,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband is due to
OL,13,Fannounce the move in the House of
OL,14,FCommons this afternoon
OL,16,FThe settlements are illegal under
OL,17,Finternational law - the UK's move comes
OL,18,Fas Israel opens tenders for 1,200 new
OL,19,Fhomes in the occupied territory
